OL,3,GNEWSASuspended PC dies after being hit
OL,4,Aby train
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer under investigation
OL,7,Ffor gross misconduct has died after
OL,8,Fbeing struck by a train.
OL,10,FPC Alex Ayre, who served with Dorset
OL,11,FPolice in Bournemouth and Boscombe,
OL,12,Fdied near Branksome, Poole, on the
OL,13,Fmorning of Friday 25 September.
OL,15,FThe 24-year-old, whose death is not
OL,16,Fbeing treated as suspicious, was
OL,17,Fsuspended while an investigation took
OL,18,Fplace into his behaviour while off
OL,19,Fduty.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
