OL,3,GNEWSASuspended PC dies after being hit
OL,4,Aby train
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement Ayre's family said he
OL,7,Fwas important "to many people" and
OL,8,Flosing him had left a space in their
OL,9,Flives that "can never be filled".
